# Constant propagation + algebraic simplifications demo.
# Shows:
# - baryabol becomes compile-time constant when RHS is fully constant
# - constant declaration uses propagated constant in expression
# - algebraic neutral element simplifications (x + 0, x * 1, x / 1) are logged in semantic output

gamitin magpakita

baryabol x = 2 + 3 * 4
konstant y = x + 0
konstant z = y * 1
konstant w = z / 1

magpakita w
